& [J01]
  + A4 is the first unresolved dependency after published A3; isolated correspondence advances the executable packet without inventing authority
& [J02]
  + separate expected key label UUID and sequence prevent unnoticed substitution relative to the request while conserving the absence of authenticated trust
& [J03]
  + A3 packet lineage avoids self-referential hashing; current A4 packet is bound by the request after raw witness identity exists
& [J04]
  + inclusive explicit comparisons and no subtraction prevent edge ambiguity and integer overflow
& [J05]
  + independent raw evidence replay makes producer claims falsifiable across restart; false authority and effect fields prevent descriptive success from becoming execution permission
& [J06]
  + immutable formation and per-element commit history make development intent recoverable without rewriting published history
